; hledger uses `include <path>` to compose journals across files.
; Relative paths resolve from the including file's directory.
;
; This fixture validates the include directive end-to-end: the main
; journal pulls in account declarations from one child and transactions
; from another. The known balances reflect the full composed view.

include include-accounts.journal
include include-transactions.journal

2024-03-01 * Coffee shop
    Expenses:Food                    $4.50
    Assets:Cash                     -$4.50
